				<title>AION 2十月更新：远征Boss削弱、新硬核本与职业血量上调</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-10-28-3393110-693d0579/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:43:27 +0800</pubDate>
